# Compiled JS leaking into the TS source tree.
#
# All admin-web source is .ts/.tsx. A stray `tsc` (without --noEmit) or a
# misconfigured editor can emit sibling .js files next to each .tsx — and
# because imports are extensionless, Vite/TS resolve the .js OVER the .tsx,
# silently serving STALE compiled code (the "frozen hash" stale-build bug).
# Never commit these; never let them shadow source.
src/**/*.js
src/**/*.js.map

# Vite build output
dist/
